[49231]={ -- Valdred Moray
  ["What... what's going on? Who are you? What happened to me?"]=1,
  ["I... died? Yes, you're right. I died. It was an orc... he cut off my hands, and left me to die. <Valdred looks down at his hands.> These aren't my hands! THESE AREN'T MY HANDS!"]=2,
  ["<Valdred looks back down at his hands.> I suppose this is my fate then. Hah! Part of an undead army. Somehow I never considered that I might end up fighting for the Forsaken. <He looks back up at you.> What do I do now?"]=3,
},
[50027]={ -- Dargad
  ["I don't train your kind druid."]=1,
},
[50028]={ -- Chintoka
  ["Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control druid."]=1,
},
[50029]={ -- Egnom
  ["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane. Sadly, they will remain a secret to you."]=1,
},
[50032]={ -- Tarmod
  ["Don't waste my time."]=1,
},
[50033]={ -- Ging
  ["I don't train your kind, druid. Find your own trainer before you anger me."]=1,
},
[63272]={ -- Ting, Strong of Stomach
  ["I will say, the Forsaken have... strange taste when it comes to brew. I get the feeling they're not exactly preparing it for friends, though."]=1,
},
[78952]={ -- Coriander
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[85923]={ -- Rangari Laandon
  ["In my days with the rangari, I have learned many nuances of skinning the varied beasts of Draenor. Now that I am in Stormshield, however, I find it is much more enjoyable to pass these teachings onto others, than to toil in the fields with the skinning knife. Wouldn't you agree?"]=1,
},
[86175]={ -- Bregg Coppercast
  ["Are you sure you want to buy th'gear I've got for sale? Crunchpaw has th' best stuff these days. B'tween the two of us, I heard she didn't get her nickname from fightin' the Horde. Don't tell her I said that. Actually, I'd prefer y'din't even mention that we spoke. I'm not on her good side right now."]=1,
},
[87052]={ -- Artificer Harlaan
  ["I sell designs for the techniques used to harness the power of Draenor's crystals. If you are skilled enough, you may benefit greatly from this knowledge."]=1,
},
[87057]={ -- Leara Moonsilk
  ["Ready to turn those raggedy old leathers into something worth wearing?"]=1,
},
[87243]={ -- Zaalendor
  ["A model with skill such as mine does not come without dedication. I have spent a lifetime perfecting my signature poses."]=1,
},
[98148]={ -- Nassar
  ["You seem like the type that just wants a fight. If you're interested, the Horde needs more troops."]=1,
},
[129679]={ -- Shani Ward
  ["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[132215]={ -- Lightforged Vindicator
  ["Light be with you."]=1,
},
[133332]={ -- Statiks Quikfuse
  ["These machines are fantastic! How could they operate with no anomalies or chance of failure? Oh, excuse me. Did you need something?"]=1,
},
[188054]={ -- Azure Guardian
